.TH CUDDLE-TUI 1 "2026-11-04" "cuddle 1.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cuddle-tui \- offline Litmo terminal room hub
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cuddle-tui
.RI [ hub | signal | ROOM_ID ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The Python and ncurses backends use the same libcuddle room engine.
Run cuddle --rooms for room IDs. An interactive terminal is required.
.SH CONTROLS
Up/down or j/k selects. Enter or space chooses. Numbers 1 through 6
choose step options. b goes back; Page Up/Down scrolls.
q or Escape stops. A second stop key leaves the stop screen.
Nothing is saved. Touch Language is a map, never consent.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cuddle (1),
.BR cuddle-gui (1)
